      "comment": "LOUGLE (12) has raced two times this campaign and has filled a minor placing on each occasion. Settled in the leading division then went to the lead only to be claimed in the run home and finish third last start over 2240m at this track. Beautifully placed and is sure to play a major role. SAVON DE ROCHE (5) is racing well with four top-five finishes in succession, the latest effort a second at Charlton over 2100m. Taking on a better line-up this time but she is up to the challenge. THE NAKED ART (9) is on the radar after her last-start fourth over 2240m here a week ago. Top-three aspirations. HIGHLANDHARTBREAKA (10) is the next elect off a last-start win by 1.2 metres at this circuit over 1200m. Can go back-to-back.",
